    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "65_g5_sakikodininghall",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_dishes",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#11$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm\u2014this is wonderful!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1940_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you think? My cooking's really improved, eh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Father"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1941_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't know the half of it, Sakiko... He had me taste-test so much in order to finally get to this point.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1940_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_plateplace",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry and give this salad a try, hm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Father"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#11$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmh! Delicious!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1940_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've made a lot of minor adjustments so it's more to your liking! Not half bad, eh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Father"
    },
    {
        "text": "And there's plenty more dishes you love on the way!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Father"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#11$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yep!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
