    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "action": "shake",
        "random": true,
        "power": 5,
        "times": 50,
        "duration": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Ngh... Ugh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1941_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sakiko? Sakiko!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1940_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-What's wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Father"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think\u2014I've had a little too much to eat...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "31_g3_mini12_farmland",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$saferoom_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1941_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you feeling better now...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1940_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, I think I overdid it a little...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Father"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1941_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Honestly, your father never changes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1941_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that's his style, I suppose. Honestly, most times it's quite adorable of him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll forgive him, won't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Can I truly forgive him?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "When the man who shares his face has broken my heart countless times?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1941_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He really loves you, you know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1941_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And so do I.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "text": "I really love the both of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mother, where is this coming from...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1941_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been going through our photo albums more and more while you were away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "text": "I started from when you were born... then when you were one, then two, then three...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "My childhood memory nearly failed me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1941_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe. But there's nothing more important, nothing more special to a parent than their child.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "text": "When you were born, your palm wasn't even half as big as mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "text": "But look at you now. Yours is even a little bigger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sakiko's mother takes her hand and brings their palms together."
    },
    {
        "text": "For some reason beyond herself, Sakiko grasps her mother's hand and locks fingers with hers."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#13$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mother, your hand is so warm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Was this how warm her palm is?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Is this all real? Is everything I'm enjoying right now rational, reasonable?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "How can it be this warm, and yet this heartrending?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1941_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right. I'm right here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#8$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mother...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1941_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go on. You can cry all you want. I always comforted you like this when you cried.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#8$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Was I... really such a crybaby?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1941_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "When you were very, veeery little. Oh, you would make the biggest fuss over a single sweet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "text": "You may be a strong young woman now, but you were a big crybaby back then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "R-Really? I don't remember at all...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1941_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "*giggle* Your mother would never lie to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then... Do you remember my high school entrance ceremony?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "During my last year of middle school, my mother died of illness.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Even if they're nonexistent memories, even if they're things that never happened.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "But right now, all I want is the most beautiful answers I can get.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I want to convince myself, to create the most wonderful memories, to believe in the sweetest dream I can.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1941_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. I remember you in your school uniform. Our whole family took a photo together at the school gate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#13$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, that sounds right... Oh, that does bring me back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What else have we done together? Mother... I want you to tell me. Tell me about all the memories we share.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
