        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm... Well, if you want, I'll reminisce a little more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now where should I begin?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's start from when I was born. I want to hear it all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1941_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay, then we'll start from the day you were born...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "And so, down the country path, at a leisurely pace, Sakiko and her mother walk side-by-side, and it feels as if they could walk forever."
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like that sweet, beautiful stretch of time they shared back when it all began. Unhurried and without end."
    },
    {
        "text": "Their hands, the umbilical cord that connected them in the very beginning."
    },
